{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#card-zh","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-ocr 是面向 DSH 的离线 OCR 插件，为 Harness 注册一个模型可调用的 ocr 工具。它通过本地 Python 脚本识别图片和 PDF，并返回识别文本、图片逐行结果或 PDF 分页结果。自动模式依次尝试 Windows 原生 OCR、RapidOCR 和 Tesseract，也可指定引擎或开启图片预处理。适合需要让文本模型读取截图、扫描件或文档文字的场景；插件配置可指定 Python、脚本路径和单次超时，识别依赖在本机提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-114","index.js:168-189","scripts/ocr_tool.py:243-283","scripts/ocr_tool.py:328-355"]}
{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#card-en","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-local-ocr adds offline OCR to DSH. A local Python script recognizes images and PDFs, returning text by line or page. It tries Windows OCR, RapidOCR, then Tesseract, or a selected engine. Image preprocessing is optional. Python, an OCR engine, and required libraries must be available locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-114","index.js:168-189","scripts/ocr_tool.py:243-283","scripts/ocr_tool.py:328-355"]}
