{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#feature-1","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-ocr 的功能「图片文字识别」：ocr 工具接收图片路径，可选指定引擎或预处理，并返回合并文本及逐行文字与分数。支持 PNG、JPG、BMP、WebP、TIFF 和 GIF。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:96-114","scripts/ocr_tool.py:32-33","scripts/ocr_tool.py:343-351"]}
{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#feature-2","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-ocr 的功能「PDF逐页识别」：ocr 工具接收 PDF 路径，将各页转为图像后识别，并返回非空页面的页码和文字；渲染库不可用时尝试提取 PDF 文本层。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/ocr_tool.py:288-325","scripts/ocr_tool.py:335-342"]}
{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#feature-3","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-ocr 的功能「本地引擎自动回退」：图片识别可自动尝试 Windows 原生 OCR、RapidOCR 和 Tesseract，也可选择 auto、win、rapid 或 tess，前序引擎无结果时继续尝试后续引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["scripts/ocr_tool.py:243-283","index.js:20-21"]}
{"unit_id":"Daive1119__local-ocr#feature-4","repo":"Daive1119/local-ocr","commit":"3191e1b98870cfc4174f01ee5258e7e14a1025b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-ocr 的功能「图片预处理增强」：调用者可为图片开启预处理；脚本放大图像、转灰度、拉伸对比度并轻度降噪，再交给识别引擎。PDF 输入忽略此开关。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:110-113","scripts/ocr_tool.py:104-122","scripts/ocr_tool.py:249-258"]}
